# other agents work trees (embedded repos)
.claude/worktrees/

# Baked laminate stays OUT of git: the source plank scans are proprietary (not CC0),
# so their derivatives cannot be redistributed. Rebuilt via RoomPlanner > Bake Laminate.
# The CC0 set (ambientCG) and our procedural ceramic bakes ARE committed — with .meta,
# because the scene references their GUIDs (CI builds straight from a clean checkout).
Assets/RoomPlanner/Textures/Laminate/*.png
Assets/RoomPlanner/Textures/Laminate/*.png.meta

# temporary IFC samples (github.com/youshengCode/IfcSampleFiles)
TestData/

# Unity test-runner / input autogenerated artifacts
Assets/Resources/PerformanceTestRun*.json*
Assets/StreamingAssets/RuntimeActionBindings.json*
